---
title: "Purchase import attempt (code)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
  state "No import yet" as s0
  state "Import running" as s1
  state "Matched an existing bill" as s2
  state "Stopped, no stock" as s3
  state "Draft bill saved" as s4
  state "Import running, worker gone" as s5
  state "Intake blocked after a saved bill" as s6
  state "Stock added from the bill" as s7
  [*] --> s0
  s0 --> s1: the upload registers the import
  s0 --> s2: a manager recovers it with another bill's original open
  s0 --> s3: a manager recovers the import / the pharmacist stops the import
  s1 --> s2: a manager recovers it with another bill's original open / the worker records the outcome
  s1 --> s3: a manager recovers the import / the pharmacist stops the import / the worker records the outcome
  s1 --> s4: the worker saves the draft bill
  s1 --> s5: the worker process dies
  s4 --> s6: a manager recovers it with another bill's original open
  s4 --> s7: the pharmacist presses Add to stock / the worker adds stock
  s5 --> s2: a manager recovers it with another bill's original open
  s5 --> s3: a manager recovers the import / the pharmacist stops the import
  s7 --> s6: a manager recovers it with another bill's original open
  classDef breaks fill:#fde2dd,stroke:#b3261e,stroke-width:2px
  classDef stuck fill:#fdf0d5,stroke:#a35a05,stroke-width:2px,stroke-dasharray:5 3
  class s6 breaks
